Package: devjam-live-boot-hooks
Version: 1.19-2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Boot hooks for dev-jam Debian Live images
 Shell hooks for Debian Live images that configure autologin and the
 default session for several desktops (KDE, GNOME, Xfce, Cinnamon, MATE,
 LXQt, LXDE, Budgie, Openbox, Kodi) on X11 or Wayland, switch
 compositing on or off, and set up the XLibre modesetting driver (with
 atomic mode setting and async flips on secondary outputs, optionally
 with variable refresh rate).
 The hooks are installed in /usr/share/devjam/hooks.
